- Moderate modulus + high pore fraction: 17-0add-13deg-100s (260.1, 0.648), 17-0add-13deg-100s_run2 (354.4, 0.609)

**Best balanced candidate:** `17-0add-13deg-100s-N2-1800s_run2` (354.4 bar, 0.609 pore fraction) — only 2 independent syntheses, one with a discard. This is a strong Pareto-front candidate combining high modulus AND high pore fraction. It needs validation (only 2 runs, one with a fit discard, high variability between runs: run1=260 bar/0.648 vs run2=354 bar/0.609).

